# Agent tooling. The 65 MB worktree copy stays out. Skills live in
# .agents/skills/ (tracked); .claude/skills/ holds symlinks into it, and those
# are tracked too — Claude Code only reads .claude/skills/, so without them a
# fresh clone sees none of the skills CLAUDE.md names.
.claude/*
!.claude/launch.json
!.claude/skills/
.opencode/

